<section class="section wrap" id="description">
  <div class="sec-head" data-reveal>
    <span class="sec-head__no">1.0</span>
    <span class="sec-head__title">GENERAL DESCRIPTION</span>
    <span class="sec-head__meta label">PAGE 01</span>
  </div>

  <div class="desc" data-reveal>
    <p class="desc__text">
      Self-taught maker from Poland. Specializing in low-power electronics and the physical
      web — connected devices designed, soldered and shipped end-to-end: solar weather
      stations, RF pager networks, sensor experiments, and the software around them, from
      C++ firmware to SwiftUI apps. Building tools that bridge the gap between digital
      intent and hardware reality. Focused on observability, resilience, and industrial
      aesthetics.
    </p>
    <div class="desc__aside">
      <span class="label">SCOPE OF DOCUMENT</span>
      <p class="desc__aside-text">
        This document indexes selected works, operating characteristics and ordering
        information of one (1) hardware maker. Specifications subject to continuous
        improvement without notice.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

